#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:4
msgid "Adding a New Device Backend"
msgstr "添加新的设备后端"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:6
msgid ""
"This guide explains how to add a **new accelerator** to LMCache in "
"**Multiprocess (MP) mode**."
msgstr "本指南解释了如何在 **多进程 (MP) 模式** 下向 LMCache 添加一个 **新加速器**。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:9
msgid ""
"**For basic users:** read :ref:`Part 1 <part-1-basic>` only — adding a "
"``DeviceSpec`` is all you need to get your device working with the built-"
"in Python fallback ops."
msgstr "**对于基础用户：** 只需阅读 :ref:`Part 1 <part-1-basic>` — 添加一个 ``DeviceSpec`` 就足以让您的设备与内置的 Python 后备操作一起工作。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:13
msgid ""
"**For advanced users:** continue to :ref:`Part 2 <part-2-performance>` "
"for native ops and advanced transfer modes."
msgstr "**对于高级用户：** 继续阅读 :ref:`Part 2 <part-2-performance>` 以了解原生操作和高级传输模式。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:19
msgid "Part 1 — Basic Function Enabling"
msgstr "第 1 部分 — 基本功能启用"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:21
msgid ""
"For the majority of devices, a single ``DeviceSpec`` class is sufficient."
"  LMCache ships with a complete Python fallback ops "
"(``lmcache/python_ops_fallback.py``) that works on any device supporting "
"standard PyTorch tensor operations — **no custom kernels required**."
msgstr "对于大多数设备，一个 ``DeviceSpec`` 类就足够了。 LMCache 附带一个完整的 Python 回退操作（``lmcache/python_ops_fallback.py``），可以在支持标准 PyTorch 张量操作的任何设备上工作——**无需自定义内核**。"

