#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:109
msgid ""
"The ``hasattr(torch, \"foo\")`` guard shown above is only needed for out-"
"of-tree PyTorch extensions (e.g. ``torch.musa``, ``torch.xpu`` when "
"installed as a plug-in).  For accelerators shipped inside PyTorch itself "
"(like ``torch.cuda``) a plain ``torch.foo.is_available()`` is enough."
msgstr "上面显示的 ``hasattr(torch, \"foo\")`` 保护仅在使用树外 PyTorch 扩展时需要（例如，当作为插件安装的 ``torch.musa``、``torch.xpu``）。对于 PyTorch 本身提供的加速器（如 ``torch.cuda``），只需使用简单的 ``torch.foo.is_available()`` 即可。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:115
msgid ""
"That's it.  Defining this class is enough for auto-discovery — no global "
"list or manual registration call is required.  All ops automatically "
"route through ``lmcache.python_ops_fallback``, which is not performant "
"but is functionally applicable to any device that supports the standard "
"PyTorch tensor surface.  Later, each device can provide its own ops "
"(Python, C, CUDA, Rust, or any language exposing Python bindings) to "
"override the fallback function-by-function."
msgstr "就这样。定义这个类就足够实现自动发现——不需要全局列表或手动注册调用。所有操作自动通过 ``lmcache.python_ops_fallback`` 路由，这虽然性能不佳，但在功能上适用于任何支持标准 PyTorch 张量表面的设备。之后，每个设备可以提供自己的操作（Python、C、CUDA、Rust 或任何暴露 Python 绑定的语言）来逐个覆盖回退功能。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:124
msgid "Verification"
msgstr "验证"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:126
msgid "Start LMCache server:"
msgstr "启动 LMCache 服务器："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:132
msgid ""
"Run vLLM with MP connector.  If multiple accelerators are visible on the "
"host, set ``DEVICE_TYPE`` to force LMCache to pick the new backend "
"instead of auto-detecting:"
msgstr "使用 MP 连接器运行 vLLM。如果主机上可见多个加速器，请设置 ``DEVICE_TYPE`` 强制 LMCache 选择新的后端，而不是自动检测："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:156
msgid ""
"The default transfer mode is ``auto`` (CUDA → LMCache-driven, other "
"devices → engine-driven).  The example above explicitly sets "
"``engine_driven`` so that a new non-CUDA device works without additional "
"capability checks.  For the ``lmcache_driven`` mode (IPC zero-copy), see "
":ref:`Advanced transfer mode <part-2-performance>`."
msgstr "默认传输模式为 ``auto``（CUDA → LMCache 驱动，其他设备 → 引擎驱动）。上述示例明确设置为 ``engine_driven``，以便新的非 CUDA 设备在没有额外能力检查的情况下正常工作。有关 ``lmcache_driven`` 模式（IPC 零拷贝），请参见 :ref:`Advanced transfer mode <part-2-performance>`。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:162
msgid "Check the LMCache logs — with ``ops_module = None`` you should see::"
msgstr "检查 LMCache 日志 — 使用 ``ops_module = None`` 你应该看到::"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:167
msgid ""
"This confirms your ``DeviceSpec`` was discovered and the Python fallback "
"is active.  (Once you set ``ops_module`` in :ref:`Part 2 "
"<part-2-performance>`, the second line becomes ``Using backend: "
"foo_device.ops`` instead.)"
msgstr "这确认了您的 ``DeviceSpec`` 已被发现，并且 Python 回退处于活动状态。 （一旦您在 :ref:`Part 2 <part-2-performance>` 中设置了 ``ops_module``，第二行将变为 ``Using backend: foo_device.ops``。）"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:172
msgid "Debugging checklist:"
msgstr "调试检查清单："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:174
msgid "[ ] ``torch.foo.is_available()`` returns ``True``."
msgstr "[ ] ``torch.foo.is_available()`` 返回 ``True``。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:175
msgid ""
"[ ] Set ``DEVICE_TYPE=foo`` to force selection if not picked up "
"automatically."
msgstr "[ ] 设置 ``DEVICE_TYPE=foo`` 以强制选择，如果未自动选择。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:177
msgid ""
"[ ] Log shows either ``Custom ops not supported for device: foo, using "
"fallback ops.`` (pure fallback) or ``Using backend: foo_device.ops`` "
"(custom ops loaded)."
msgstr "[ ] 日志显示 ``Custom ops not supported for device: foo, using fallback ops.`` （纯回退）或 ``Using backend: foo_device.ops`` （加载自定义操作）。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:180
msgid ""
"[ ] Engine-driven transfer works end-to-end (check the LMCache logs to "
"confirm whether the SHM or Pickle sub-path is chosen — both should "
