msgstr "[ ] 引擎驱动的传输端到端工作正常（检查 LMCache 日志以确认选择了 SHM 还是 Pickle 子路径 — 两者都应该成功）。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:183
msgid "[ ] Store/retrieve correctness is verified."
msgstr "[ ] 存储/检索的正确性已验证。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:184
msgid "[ ] TP>1 / multi-worker behavior is verified."
msgstr "[ ] TP>1 / 多工作进程行为已验证。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:189
msgid "Part 2 — Performance Optimization"
msgstr "第二部分 — 性能优化"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:191
msgid "Once basic functionality is verified, add device-specific optimizations."
msgstr "一旦基本功能得到验证，添加设备特定的优化。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:195
msgid "Device-specific ops"
msgstr "设备特定操作"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:197
msgid ""
"The generic ops interface is defined in "
"``lmcache/python_ops_fallback.py``.  Each vendor may replace any subset "
"of these functions with a device-specific implementation; the choice of "
"language (C, CUDA, SYCL, Python, Rust, …) and packaging is entirely up to"
" the vendor.  LMCache only cares that the resulting symbols are "
"importable from Python."
msgstr "通用操作接口在 ``lmcache/python_ops_fallback.py`` 中定义。每个供应商可以用设备特定的实现替换这些函数的任何子集；语言的选择（C、CUDA、SYCL、Python、Rust 等）和打包完全由供应商决定。LMCache 只关心结果符号是否可以从 Python 导入。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:204
msgid ""
"**How it works.** At import time, ``get_backend(device_type)`` imports "
"the module named by your ``DeviceSpec.ops_module`` and merges its symbols"
" over ``python_ops_fallback``:"
msgstr "**工作原理。** 在导入时，``get_backend(device_type)`` 导入由您的 ``DeviceSpec.ops_module`` 指定的模块，并将其符号合并到 ``python_ops_fallback`` 中："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:214
msgid "Integration contract"
msgstr "集成合同"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:216
msgid ""
"Regardless of how you build your ops module, the following contract must "
"hold:"
msgstr "无论您如何构建操作模块，以下契约必须成立："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:219
msgid ""
"**Same symbol names.** Every function you override must be exposed under "
"the exact name used in ``python_ops_fallback`` (e.g. "
"``multi_layer_block_kv_transfer``)."
msgstr "**相同的符号名称。** 你重写的每个函数必须以 ``python_ops_fallback`` 中使用的确切名称公开（例如 ``multi_layer_block_kv_transfer``）。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:222
msgid ""
"**Same call signature.** Positional/keyword arguments, argument order and"
" semantics must match the fallback; callers invoke the merged module "
"without knowing which backend answered."
msgstr "**相同的调用签名。** 位置参数/关键字参数、参数顺序和语义必须与回退匹配；调用者在调用合并模块时并不知道是哪个后端响应。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:225
msgid ""
"**Importable Python module.** ``ops_module`` is a fully-qualified Python "
"module path (``importlib.import_module`` must succeed).  How the module "
"gets there — a pure-Python file, a pybind11 extension, a ctypes wrapper, "
"a Rust ``PyO3`` module, etc. — is your choice."
msgstr "**可导入的 Python 模块。** ``ops_module`` 是一个完全合格的 Python 模块路径（``importlib.import_module`` 必须成功）。模块如何到达那里——一个纯 Python 文件、一个 pybind11 扩展、一个 ctypes 包装器、一个 Rust ``PyO3`` 模块等——由你选择。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:229
msgid ""
"**Partial override is allowed.** You do not have to reimplement every "
"function.  Anything you leave out keeps using the Python fallback, so "
"incremental optimization is supported."
msgstr "**允许部分重写。** 您不必重新实现每个函数。您省略的任何内容将继续使用 Python 回退，因此支持增量优化。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:232
msgid ""
"**Point ``DeviceSpec.ops_module`` at the module** once it is reachable on"
" ``sys.path``:"
msgstr "**将 ``DeviceSpec.ops_module`` 指向模块** 一旦它可以在 ``sys.path`` 上访问："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:243
msgid "Implementation notes"
msgstr "实现说明"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:245
msgid ""
"``multi_layer_block_kv_transfer`` and ``lmcache_memcpy_async`` are the "
"hot entry points for both engine-driven and LMCache-driven transfer; "
"other functions in ``python_ops_fallback`` can be overridden as needed."
msgstr "``multi_layer_block_kv_transfer`` 和 ``lmcache_memcpy_async`` 是引擎驱动和 LMCache 驱动传输的主要入口点；``python_ops_fallback`` 中的其他函数可以根据需要被重写。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:249
msgid ""
"If you fall back to the generic path from inside a device-specific "
"wrapper (e.g. when inputs are unsupported), call the corresponding "
"``lmcache.python_ops_fallback`` function directly to preserve semantics."
msgstr "如果您在设备特定的包装器内部回退到通用路径（例如，当输入不受支持时），请直接调用相应的 ``lmcache.python_ops_fallback`` 函数以保持语义。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:253
msgid ""
"Keep your ops module free of side effects at import time — it is imported"
" eagerly during ``get_backend()``."
msgstr "在导入时保持你的 ops 模块没有副作用——它在 ``get_backend()`` 中被急切导入。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:256
msgid ""
"For concrete reference implementations, see ``lmcache/v1/platform/cuda/``"
" and ``lmcache/v1/platform/musa/``. Both are examples of what a vendor "
"*may* do, not templates every new backend has to follow."
msgstr "有关具体的参考实现，请参见 ``lmcache/v1/platform/cuda/`` 和 ``lmcache/v1/platform/musa/``。这两者都是供应商 *可能* 采取的示例，而不是每个新后端必须遵循的模板。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:262
msgid "Advanced transfer mode"
msgstr "高级传输模式"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:264
msgid ""
"By default, the transfer mode is **AUTO**: the router dispatches strictly"
" by ``device_type`` — ``device_type == \"cuda\"`` goes to "
"``LMCacheDrivenTransferContext`` (IPC zero-copy), everything else to "
"``EngineDrivenTransferContext``.  A non-CUDA device that supports IPC "
"handle transfer can still opt into LMCache-driven explicitly (below)."
msgstr "默认情况下，传输模式为 **AUTO**：路由器严格按照 ``device_type`` 分发 — ``device_type == \\\"cuda\\\"`` 的设备使用 ``LMCacheDrivenTransferContext``（IPC 零拷贝），其他设备则使用 ``EngineDrivenTransferContext``。支持 IPC 句柄传输的非 CUDA 设备仍然可以显式选择 LMCache 驱动（如下所述）。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:272
msgid ""
"ROCm is not a separate backend: under PyTorch a ROCm GPU reports "
"``device_type == \"cuda\"`` and reuses ``CudaIPCWrapper`` (CUDA IPC) for "
"the LMCache-driven path, so it works in AUTO mode with no extra setup.  "
"There is currently no dedicated ``platform/rocm`` package."
msgstr "ROCm 不是一个单独的后端：在 PyTorch 下，ROCm GPU 报告 ``device_type == \\\"cuda\\\"`` 并重用 ``CudaIPCWrapper``（CUDA IPC）用于 LMCache 驱动的路径，因此它在 AUTO 模式下工作，无需额外设置。目前没有专门的 ``platform/rocm`` 包。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:277
msgid ""
"When the caller (or ``LMCACHE_MP_TRANSFER_MODE``) explicitly requests "
"``lmcache_driven``, ``_build_lmcache_driven_context`` performs two hard "
"checks — both must succeed, otherwise the factory raises ``ValueError`` "
"(no silent fallback):"
msgstr "当调用者（或 ``LMCACHE_MP_TRANSFER_MODE``）明确请求 ``lmcache_driven`` 时，``_build_lmcache_driven_context`` 会执行两个严格检查 — 两者必须成功，否则工厂会引发 ``ValueError``（没有静默回退）："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:282
msgid ""
"Your ``DeviceSpec`` subclass must bind a ``DeviceIPCWrapper`` subclass "
"(exposing a ``wrap`` classmethod) via "
":attr:`~lmcache.v1.platform.base_device_spec.DeviceSpec.ipc_wrapper_cls`."
" :func:`~lmcache.v1.platform.resolve_kv_wrapper_factory` reads that "
"binding off the registered spec — no separate registry / auto-scan."
msgstr "您的 ``DeviceSpec`` 子类必须通过 :attr:`~lmcache.v1.platform.base_device_spec.DeviceSpec.ipc_wrapper_cls` 绑定一个 ``DeviceIPCWrapper`` 子类（暴露一个 ``wrap`` 类方法）。 :func:`~lmcache.v1.platform.resolve_kv_wrapper_factory` 从注册的规范中读取该绑定 — 无需单独的注册表 / 自动扫描。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:287
msgid ""
"``DeviceSpec.is_handle_transfer_available()`` must return ``True`` (the "
"base-class default; override to ``False`` only if your device lacks IPC "
"handle transfer)."
msgstr "``DeviceSpec.is_handle_transfer_available()`` 必须返回 ``True``（基类默认值；仅当您的设备缺少 IPC 句柄传输时才重写为 ``False``）。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:291
msgid ""
"Separately, the LMCache-driven server module also requires a "
"``BaseCacheContext`` subclass under "
"``lmcache/v1/platform/foo/cache_context.py``.  ``create_cache_context`` "
"discovers it lazily at runtime and raises ``ValueError`` if no backend "
"matches the device type; it manages the KV cache layout and pointers used"
" for IPC transfer."
msgstr "另外，基于 LMCache 的服务器模块还需要一个位于 ``lmcache/v1/platform/foo/cache_context.py`` 的 ``BaseCacheContext`` 子类。``create_cache_context`` 在运行时懒惰地发现它，并在没有后端与设备类型匹配时引发 ``ValueError``；它管理用于 IPC 传输的 KV Cache 布局和指针。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:298
msgid ""
"Host-side pinning via ``pin_memory_backend`` is *optional* and only "
"affects staging-buffer performance; it is not required to enable LMCache-"
"driven mode."
msgstr "通过 ``pin_memory_backend`` 在主机端固定是 *可选* 的，仅影响暂存缓冲区的性能；启用 LMCache 驱动模式并不需要它。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:302
msgid "Override these methods in your ``DeviceSpec``:"
msgstr "在你的 ``DeviceSpec`` 中重写这些方法："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend.rst:330
msgid ""
"Opt into LMCache-driven mode by setting ``lmcache.mp.mp_transfer_mode`` "
"to ``lmcache_driven`` in the vLLM ``kv_connector_extra_config`` shown in "
":ref:`Part 1 <part-1-basic>`, or by exporting "
"``LMCACHE_MP_TRANSFER_MODE=lmcache_driven``.  If either hard check fails,"
" the factory raises ``ValueError`` and refuses to construct the context —"
" switch back to ``engine_driven`` or ``auto``."
msgstr "通过在 :ref:`Part 1 <part-1-basic>` 中显示的 vLLM ``kv_connector_extra_config`` 中将 ``lmcache.mp.mp_transfer_mode`` 设置为 ``lmcache_driven``，或通过导出 ``LMCACHE_MP_TRANSFER_MODE=lmcache_driven`` 来选择 LMCache 驱动模式。如果任何硬检查失败，工厂将引发 ``ValueError`` 并拒绝构造上下文——请切换回 ``engine_driven`` 或 ``auto``。"

